# .understandignore — patterns for files/dirs to exclude from analysis
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (globs, # comments, ! negation, trailing / for dirs)
#
# Scope: "Core gameplay" — keep Controller, Mechanisms, Platforms, Interaction,
# Physics, Camera, Interfaces, Rendering, Visual. Everything below is excluded.

# --- Tooling output ---
.understand-anything/

# --- Unity metadata (not source) ---
*.meta

# --- Out-of-scope subsystems ---
Editor/
Debug/
UI/
Audio/
Effects/
Settings/
Optimization/
Background/
VFX/
MeshTools/
Input/
